<text x="12.7" y="121.92" size="1.778" layer="94">EAE Disable Jumpers (blue wire wrap):</text>
<text x="17.78" y="99.06" size="1.778" layer="94">F39F1 to GND. MQ_ENABLE</text>
<text x="17.78" y="96.52" size="1.778" layer="94">F39F2 to GND. SC_ENABLE</text>
<text x="17.78" y="109.22" size="1.778" layer="94">F24C1 to +3 volts EAE_NO_SHIFT_ENABLE</text>
<text x="17.78" y="104.14" size="1.778" layer="94">F31D2 to +3 volts EAE_MEM_ENABLE</text>
<text x="17.78" y="101.6" size="1.778" layer="94">F33P2 to GND B EAE_ON</text>
<text x="17.78" y="106.68" size="1.778" layer="94">F28R1 to +3 volts EAE_ON_</text>
<text x="17.78" y="111.76" size="1.778" layer="94">F23H2 to +3 volts EAE_E_SET</text>
<text x="17.78" y="114.3" size="1.778" layer="94">E28L1 to GND EAE_L_ DISABLE</text>
<text x="12.7" y="134.62" size="1.778" layer="94">Must tie either S or S_ to GND if no DL8i</text>
<text x="17.78" y="73.66" size="1.778" layer="94">F11M2 (or possibly F11H2 or F11N2) to F11U1, CUF to +3V</text>
<text x="17.78" y="78.74" size="1.778" layer="94">E13D1 to E15M2, UF(0) to +3V</text>
<text x="17.78" y="68.58" size="1.778" layer="94">J13U2 to H13P2 ME5 to +3V</text>
<text x="17.78" y="71.12" size="1.778" layer="94">F19N1 to F19N2 UINT to +3V</text>
<text x="17.78" y="76.2" size="1.778" layer="94">E18U1 to B4V1 SKIP ored to SKIP(1)  </text>
<text x="12.7" y="86.36" size="1.778" layer="94">KT8I Disable Jumpers (blue wire wrap):</text>
<text x="12.7" y="83.82" size="1.778" layer="94">(from Dave Gesswein)</text>
