<text x="304.8" y="27.94" size="2.54" layer="91">Notes and Table of Contents</text>
<text x="208.28" y="248.92" size="1.778" layer="94">ECOs Believed to be Integrated:</text>
<text x="210.82" y="243.84" size="1.778" layer="94">8i-00001</text>
<text x="210.82" y="193.04" size="1.778" layer="94">8i-00085</text>
<text x="223.52" y="210.82" size="1.778" layer="94">Buffer MEM_START and TP2.</text>
<text x="223.52" y="193.04" size="1.778" layer="94">Delay TP3 50ns so slow MM can meet set up for adder.</text>
<text x="12.7" y="132.08" size="1.778" layer="94">Need a proper jumper list for dl8i, like those below.</text>
<text x="111.76" y="248.92" size="1.778" layer="94">BUGBUG: TP4 seems hopelessly overloaded, given</text>
<text x="210.82" y="236.22" size="1.778" layer="94">8i-00013</text>
