<sheet>
<plain>
<text x="304.8" y="27.94" size="2.54" layer="91">D-BS-8i-0-12 Teletype Transmitter</text>
<text x="170.18" y="205.74" size="1.778" layer="94">Note: The backplane, as drawn, is configured for:</text>
<text x="177.8" y="198.12" size="1.778" layer="94">8 bit characters</text>
<text x="177.8" y="195.58" size="1.778" layer="94">2 stop bits</text>
<text x="177.8" y="200.66" size="1.778" layer="94">04 device code</text>
<text x="170.18" y="190.5" size="1.778" layer="94">Backplane wiring changes would be needed to change these settings.</text>
<text x="170.18" y="187.96" size="1.778" layer="94">This may be an issue for non-wire-wrap-backplanes.</text>
</plain>
